  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪、\r\nそれ、もしかして次の現場の衣装か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい、あんまり時間はないですけど……\r\nどうしても髪飾りを足したくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪は本当にすごいな\r\nそういうの、全部自分でやっちゃうもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そんな……こっちは本業ですから\r\nそれにこの髪飾り、お店の新作にもなるなって……♪",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030030",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、本業、か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ……ごめんなさい、プロデューサーさん\r\nそういうつもりじゃないんです、つい──",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、わかってるよ\r\n千雪は、本当にどっちも頑張ってるもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雑貨の方は、積み重ねてきた時間も長いしな……\r\nそっちのが慣れてるって意味だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\nでも、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "本当によく見てくださっているプロデューサーさんの前で、\r\n言うべきじゃない言葉でした……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030060",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、いや、やめてくれよ\r\nそういうことじゃなくて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、本当に、両方頑張ってる千雪をすごいと思ってる\r\nちゃんと、サポートするからな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい……\r\nありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃ、そろそろ時間だ\r\nもうひと頑張り、頼むな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030080",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "effect",
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はぁ～千雪、お疲れさま\r\n今日も長かったなぁ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いえ、プロデューサーさん\r\n今日のお仕事も、すっごく勉強になりました！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言ってくれるのはうれしいけど\r\n疲れた時は言ってくれよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ええ、大丈夫です",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ、そうだ、\r\nこの間の見本誌、届いてるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "見本誌……ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、この前撮影した雑誌のだよ\r\n髪飾り、作ってくれたじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪、いい感じに写ってるぞー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わぁ！\r\nありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ど、どうしたんだ？\r\n見ないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そ、その……\r\n小さく載っているだけだってわかってるんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030140",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "恥ずかしくて、見れません～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なんだそれ\r\n自信を持っていいんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "髪飾りだって、\r\nまず千雪が見てあげないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プ、プロデューサーさん……！\r\nふふ、そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ありがとうございます……♪",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、じゃあ落ち着いたら出よう\r\n次はレッスンだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい、頑張りま──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……！\r\n……あ、あら……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ど、どうした、千雪！？\r\n大丈夫か！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "す、すみません、ちょっとふらついちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり、疲れがたまっているんじゃないか\r\nちょっと……横になろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "い、いえ……\r\nもう大丈夫ですから",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030210",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫なもんか！\r\n幸い仕事じゃないんだ、レッスンは休もう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そ、それじゃ……\r\nそれじゃ、両方頑張ってる意味が……ないです……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪……\r\n無理だってこと、自分でもわかってるんだろ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "意外に頑固だよな、千雪\r\nでも、ダメだ。ここは俺の言うことをきいてくれ。な？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……は、はい\r\nごめんなさい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "このままじゃいけませんね、私……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030250",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "このままじゃ、\r\nきっと、また同じことを繰り返してしまう……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030260"
  },
  {
    "select": "ゆっくり休め",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "ゆっくり考えろ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "千雪に任せるよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢①【ゆっくり休め】"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゆっくり休め"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まずは、何も考えずにゆっくり休んだ方がいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030270,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私……すごいご迷惑を……\r\n自分の勝手のせいで……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\n俺がちゃんと見れてなくて、悪かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030280,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030290,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "少し休んだら……\r\n私、ちゃんと考えてみます",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030290",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか\r\n必ず俺に相談してくれよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢②【ゆっくり考えろ】"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ゆっくり考えろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪、本当は……\r\nこれからのこと、いろいろ考えたいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030300,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……はい\r\n目の前のことで精一杯になっていたかも……です",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030300",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030310,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "こんなふうになる前に、\r\nちゃんと考えなきゃいけないことでした……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こっちのことは気にせず、自分のことだけ考えてくれ\r\n千雪の人生だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016001030311,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\nそんなこと言わせて……ほんとに、ごめんなさい……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600103/1016001030311"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢③【千雪に任せるよ】"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪に任せるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪、いまどんな気持ちでいるかわからないけど……\r\n俺はこれからのこと、千雪に任せたいって思ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
